    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92396" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥί̄γ-ιστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Sup.
		
		Adj. formed from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιγέω</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>most horrible</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίγιστα θεοὶ τετληότες εἰμέν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.873
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς] ῥίγιστος ἀλιτροῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.215
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				292
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃ δὴ ῥίγιστον ὄδωδεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					64
				</span></i>
			.</div>
